{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-11-17 16:29:00', 'title': 'AEP OHIO RATE CASE SETTLEMENT WITH 13 OTHERS APPROVED BY PUCO', 'text': "GAHANNA, OHIO, NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AEP OHIO, AN AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) COMPANY, HAS RECEIVED APPROVAL FROM THE PUBLIC UTILITIES COMMISSION OF OHIO (PUCO) FOR NEW BASE RATES FOR ELECTRIC DISTRIBUTION SERVICE. AEP OHIO AND 13 OTHERS, INCLUDING THE PUCO STAFF, THE OFFICE OF THE OHIO CONSUMERS' COUNSEL, LARGE INDUSTRIAL CUSTOMER GROUPS AS WELL AS COMMERCIAL CUSTOMERS INCLUDING KROGER CO. AND WALMART, AND THE OHIO HOSPITAL ASSOCIATION HAD SUBMITTED TO THE PUCO AN AGREEMENT IN MARCH 2021 AND WAS APPROVED BY THE COMMISSIONERS TODAY."}{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-11-17 10:00:00', 'title': 'INDIANA MICHIGAN POWER ENTERS RATE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT THAT PROVIDES SIGNIFICANT CUSTOMER BENEFITS', 'text': 'FORT WAYNE, IND., NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INDIANA MICHIGAN POWER (I&M), AN AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) COMPANY,\xa0HAS FILED WITH THE INDIANA UTILITY REGULATORY COMMISSION (IURC) A RATE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT THAT WILL REDUCE BASE RATES FOR HOOSIER RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMERS WHILE ENHANCING RELIABILITY.'}{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-11-17 09:15:00', 'title': 'PSO ISSUES REQUESTS FOR PROPOSALS FOR PURCHASE OF WIND AND SOLAR GENERATION RESOURCES', 'text': 'TULSA, OKLA., NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY OF OKLAHOMA (PSO), A SUBSIDIARY OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP), TODAY SUBMITTED REQUESTS FOR PROPOSALS (RFP) FOR RENEWABLE ENERGY RESOURCES TO SUPPLY THE NEEDS OF ITS CUSTOMERS.'}